# (the voices batch, item 3) Choir, the Drone's formant choir, on its page's ALGORITHM: the Drone's sixth voice (after
# Glass: one turn back from Organ), Pipes its third (AISLING: in Horn's place, and Skellig's); said, kept in the
# project, heard (its vowel moving as Skellig plays: the Drone's Move page), and kept over a restart
wait 300
listen
tap ENV
wait 300
expect par22 2
spin ALGO -2
wait 300
said VOICE Organ
expect par22 0
turn ALGO -1
wait 300
said VOICE Choir
expect par22 5
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Organ
expect par22 0
spin ALGO 2
wait 300
said VOICE Pipes
expect par22 2
spin ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Harmonium
expect par22 3
spin ALGO 2
wait 300
said VOICE Choir
expect par22 5
spin ALGO -3
wait 300
said VOICE Pipes
expect par22 2
spin ALGO 3
wait 300
said VOICE Choir
expect par22 5
wait 8000
expect chwork >0
# kept: stopped, it saves itself; the same after a restart (the save's format as it was: AISLING's 1; Choir appended, nothing
# moved)
tap PLAY
wait 6000
expect dirty 0
expect store_writes >0
reboot
wait 500
expect format 1
expect par22 5
